Garmi Description
Copyright 2026 Technical University of Munich

This product includes software and 3D assets developed at the
Technical University of Munich (TUM).

The Garmi robot design (head, neck, torso, covers and overall integration)
was created in collaboration with Leap Leap (https://leap-leap.com/).

The head camera's mesh (meshes/olive_camera.stl and its copy under
mujoco/assets/) is simplified from Olive Robotics' CAD model of the camera;
its collision proxy (meshes/collision/olive_camera.stl and its copy) encloses
that camera together with its TUM-designed housing and lens cover.

